# Keeps `COPY . .` from ingesting things the build must never see.
#
# The locally-built host binary was tracked in git and copied into every
# image build (report S8a) -- a 15MB macOS binary landing in a Linux
# image layer, unverified, in a product whose whole purpose is detecting
# exactly that.
monitor-api

# Build/VCS noise that only invalidates the layer cache.
.git
.gitignore
*_test.go
testdata/
